# Correctness 要求

任何性能优化必须保证：

```text
pread/pwrite correctness
read-after-write
overlapping write ordering
append
truncate
resize
close/reuse fd
dup semantics
fsync
fdatasync
metadata durability
crash consistency
```

实验性的：

```text
HFS_ORDERING=none
HFS_WAIT_MODE=spin
```

只能用于受控 benchmark，不得作为默认模式。

